{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Reach Out — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfb;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#6b5ce6;--accent-2:#7dd3fc;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f3f7ff);color:#0f172a}
    header{position:sticky;top:0;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.3));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04)}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:600}
    .nav{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-left:auto}
    .nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    .nav a.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:48px 24px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:220px;}
    .hero-inner{max-width:900px}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}
    .hero p.lead{margin:12px 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:24px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.06)}
    label{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e6e9ee;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:140px}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    button{background:var(--accent);border:none;color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}
    button.secondary{background:#eef2ff;color:var(--accent)}

    .info-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    footer{padding:28px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Reveal animations */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity 520ms ease,transform 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    /* Modal */
    .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(2,6,23,0.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:60;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity 220ms}
    .overlay.open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
    .modal{width:min(720px,94%);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.98),white);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(2,6,23,0.35)}
    .modal header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .exercise-stage{display:none}
    .exercise-stage.active{display:block}

    /* Breathing circle */
    .breath-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .circle{width:160px;height:160px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, #e8f0ff, #f9fbff);box-shadow:inset 0 -8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.03)}
    .pulse{width:60%;height:60%;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));opacity:0.9;transform:scale(1);transition:transform 400ms ease}
    .countdown{font-size:22px;font-weight:600}

    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{display:none}.hero{padding:28px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;align-items:center">
      <div class="brand">
        <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden>
          <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="6" fill="url(#g)"/>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#7dd3fc"/>
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#6b5ce6"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:600">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">A private clinical practice</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Practice</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
        <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Fees & Plans</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <h1>Connect, clarify, and choose your next careful step</h1>
        <p class="lead">If you are considering short-term support, an intensive, or ongoing therapy, I offer private sessions rooted in clinical training and respectful collaboration. Reach out below and I will reply within a few business days.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
          <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="primary-cta" style="background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <button id="launch-practice" class="secondary" aria-haspopup="dialog">Begin a short practice</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:28px">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card reveal" data-reveal>
          <form id="contact-form" novalidate>
            <label for="name">Full name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required placeholder="Your name" />

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" />

            <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="(555) 555-5555" />

            <label for="reason">Primary reason for reaching out</label>
            <select id="reason" name="reason">
              <option>Time-limited focused work (intensive)</option>
              <option>Ongoing sessions</option>
              <option>Couples or relational concerns</option>
              <option>Initial consult / questions</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Brief note (what would you like to address?)</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A sentence or two helps me respond thoughtfully."></textarea>

            <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">How I will respond: I read messages during business hours and I will reply with next steps or a short intake questionnaire. Email and phone messages are treated as confidential within the limits of the law. </div>

            <div class="actions">
              <button type="submit">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" class="secondary" id="clear-form">Clear</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <aside class="card reveal" data-reveal>
          <div class="info-list">
            <div>
              <strong>Contact details</strong>
              <div class="muted">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a><br/>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <strong>Location</strong>
              <div class="muted">Serving clients in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — primarily telehealth with limited in-person availability.</div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <strong>Session types</strong>
              <div class="muted">Individual psychotherapy, focused intensives, and brief consults. If you are seeking medication management, I will provide referrals.</div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <strong>Accessibility</strong>
              <div class="muted">I aim to make space accessible. If you need accommodations, note them in your message and I will follow up.</div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap" style="margin-top:22px">
      <div class="card reveal" data-reveal>
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Confidentiality, scope, and safety</h3>
        <p class="muted">I keep clinical communications private except where required by law (for example: imminent risk of harm to self/others, suspected abuse of a minor or a vulnerable adult, or a court order). I do not provide crisis services. If you are in immediate danger or require urgent care, contact your local emergency services or a crisis line. For life-threatening emergencies, call 911.</p>
        <p class="muted">Initial messages help me determine fit and availability; they are not a substitute for a clinical intake. I will be transparent about what I can offer and will provide referrals when appropriate.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap" style="margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:32px">
      <div class="card reveal" data-reveal>
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Short practices you can try here</h3>
        <p class="muted">Use the mini-practice to settle a moment of overwhelm, reflect briefly, or set an intention before a session. The exercises are self-guided and store nothing beyond your device's local storage.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px">
          <button id="open-practice-quick">Open guided mini-practice</button>
          <button id="open-journal" class="secondary">Open journaling tool</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="muted">Sessions are private and confidential within legal limits. This site is informational and not a substitute for therapy. If you are experiencing a crisis, call emergency services. &nbsp;|&nbsp; &copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Modal / Guided practice -->
  <div id="overlay" class="overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <header>
        <h2 id="practice-title">Guided Micro-Practice</h2>
        <div>
          <button id="prev-step" class="secondary">Back</button>
          <button id="close-practice" aria-label="Close">Close</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main style="margin-top:12px">
        <div id="stage-select" class="exercise-stage active">
          <p class="muted">Choose a short focus. Each option is 2–5 minutes and runs in your browser only.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px">
            <button data-stage="breath">Breathing (2 min)</button>
            <button data-stage="journal">Journaling (5 min)</button>
            <button data-stage="intent">Set an intention (2 min)</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="breath" class="exercise-stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="breath-wrap">
            <div class="circle" aria-hidden>
              <div id="pulse" class="pulse"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="countdown" id="breath-count">Get ready</div>
            <div class="muted">Follow the expanding circle: inhale, hold, exhale. Start when you are ready.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px">
              <button id="start-breath">Start</button>
              <button id="stop-breath" class="secondary">Stop</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="journal" class="exercise-stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="muted">A short prompt to notice and write. Your writing stays on this device unless you copy or clear it.</p>
          <label for="prompt">Prompt</label>
          <select id="prompt">
            <option>What is one small thing that would make today a bit easier?</option>
            <option>What feeling is most present right now? Name it without judgment.</option>
            <option>What would you like to remember from this week?</option>
          </select>
          <textarea id="journal-text" placeholder="Write freely for a few minutes..."></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button id="save-journal">Save locally</button>
            <button id="clear-journal" class="secondary">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <div id="journal-saved" class="muted" style="margin-top:8px;display:none">Saved to your device.</div>
        </div>

        <div id="intent" class="exercise-stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="muted">State an intention you can return to during the day.</p>
          <input id="intent-input" type="text" placeholder="My intention for today is..." />
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button id="save-intent">Save intention</button>
            <button id="clear-intent" class="secondary">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <div id="intent-list" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
        </div>

      </main>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Utilities
    function el(id){return document.getElementById(id)}
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Form behaviour
    const form = el('contact-form');
    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      // Minimal client-side validation
      const name = form.name.value.trim();
      const email = form.email.value.trim();
      if(!name || !email){
        alert('Please provide your name and email.');
        return;
      }
      // This is a demo: show a thank you message and clear optional fields
      alert('Thanks — your message has been noted. I will reply soon.');
      form.reset();
    });
    el('clear-form').addEventListener('click', ()=>form.reset());

    // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const nodes = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]'));
      if(prefersReduced){
        nodes.forEach(n=>n.classList.add('visible'));
        return;
      }
      const opts = {threshold:0.12};
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
        entries.forEach(entry=>{
          if(entry.isIntersecting){
            entry.target.classList.add('visible');
            io.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      }, opts);
      nodes.forEach(n=>io.observe(n));
    })();

    // Modal + guided practice logic
    const overlay = el('overlay');
    const launch = el('launch-practice');
    const openQuick = el('open-practice-quick');
    const openJournal = el('open-journal');
    const closeBtn = el('close-practice');
    const prevBtn = el('prev-step');

    function openModal(){ overlay.classList.add('open'); showStage('stage-select'); document.body.style.overflow='hidden'; }
    function closeModal(){ overlay.classList.remove('open'); showStage('stage-select'); document.body.style.overflow=''; }

    launch.addEventListener('click', openModal);
    openQuick.addEventListener('click', openModal);
    openJournal.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ openModal(); setTimeout(()=>selectStage('journal'),50); });
    closeBtn.addEventListener('click', closeModal);

    // Stage navigation
    const stages = ['stage-select','breath','journal','intent'];
    function showStage(id){ stages.forEach(s=>{const el=document.getElementById(s); if(!el) return; if(s===id){ el.classList.add('active'); el.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false'); } else { el.classList.remove('active'); el.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); }});
    }
    function selectStage(key){ showStage(key); }

    // Buttons that pick a stage
    document.querySelectorAll('#stage-select button[data-stage]').forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        selectStage(btn.getAttribute('data-stage'));
      });
    });

    prevBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=> showStage('stage-select'));

    // Breathing exercise
    const pulse = el('pulse');
    const breathCount = el('breath-count');
    let breathInterval = null;
    function animateBreath(){
      let phase = 0; // 0 inhale, 1 hold, 2 exhale
      let cycles = 0; // run for a couple cycles, total ~2 minutes
      const maxCycles = 4; // each cycle ~30s
      breathCount.textContent='Ready';
      pulse.style.transform='scale(1)';
      clearInterval(breathInterval);
      breathInterval = setInterval(()=>{
        if(phase===0){ pulse.style.transform='scale(1.6)'; breathCount.textContent='Inhale'; }
        else if(phase===1){ breathCount.textContent='Hold'; }
        else{ pulse.style.transform='scale(1)'; breathCount.textContent='Exhale'; }
        phase = (phase+1)%3;
        if(phase===0) cycles++;
        if(cycles>=maxCycles){ clearInterval(breathInterval); breathCount.textContent='Done'; }
      }, 2000);
    }
    el('start-breath').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ animateBreath(); });
    el('stop-breath').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ clearInterval(breathInterval); breathCount.textContent='Stopped'; pulse.style.transform='scale(1)'; });

    // Journaling: save to local storage
    const journalText = el('journal-text');
    const journalSaved = el('journal-saved');
    const promptSel = el('prompt');
    el('save-journal').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const val = journalText.value.trim();
      if(!val){ alert('Write something to save.'); return; }
      const key = 'practice_journal_' + new Date().toISOString();
      localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify({prompt:promptSel.value,text:val,ts:Date.now()}));
      journalSaved.style.display='block';
      setTimeout(()=>journalSaved.style.display='none',2500);
    });
    el('clear-journal').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ journalText.value=''; });

    // Intention list
    const intentInput = el('intent-input');
    const intentList = el('intent-list');
    function renderIntents(){
      const raw = localStorage.getItem('intents') || '[]';
      const arr = JSON.parse(raw);
      if(!arr.length){ intentList.innerHTML='<div class="muted">No saved intentions</div>'; return; }
      intentList.innerHTML = '<ul style="padding-left:18px;margin:0;">'+arr.map((i,idx)=>'<li style="margin-bottom:6px">'+escapeHtml(i)+' <button data-idx="'+idx+'" style="margin-left:8px" class="secondary">delete</button></li>').join('')+'</ul>';
      Array.from(intentList.querySelectorAll('button[data-idx]')).forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{
        const i = Number(b.getAttribute('data-idx'));
        const arr = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('intents')||'[]'); arr.splice(i,1); localStorage.setItem('intents',JSON.stringify(arr)); renderIntents();
      }));
    }
    function escapeHtml(s){return s.replace(/[&<>"']/g, function(c){return{'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":"&#39;"}[c];});}
    el('save-intent').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const v = intentInput.value.trim(); if(!v) return; const arr = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('intents')||'[]'); arr.unshift(v); localStorage.setItem('intents',JSON.stringify(arr)); intentInput.value=''; renderIntents();
    });
    el('clear-intent').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ localStorage.removeItem('intents'); renderIntents(); });
    renderIntents();

    // Accessibility: keyboard close
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key==='Escape'){ if(overlay.classList.contains('open')) closeModal(); } });

    // Focus management for modal
    overlay.addEventListener('click', function(e){ if(e.target===overlay) closeModal(); });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the private practice site

Files in this bundle:
- contact.html — The contact page and guided micro-practice modal. Includes:
  - A contact form with client-side validation (demo alert on submit).
  - Confidentiality + crisis notice.
  - A guided, in-browser micro-practice (breathing, journaling, intention) that stores only to localStorage and runs purely on the client.
  - Scroll-triggered reveal animations with respects for prefers-reduced-motion.
  - No external assets or CDNs required; references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg (create a unique SVG at that path in the site bundle).

How to test locally:
1. Place this file alongside the other site pages and assets/ directory. Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists.
2. Open contact.html in a browser (file:// works for client-only features).
3. Click "Begin a short practice" or the quick practice buttons to open the modal exercises.
4. Submit the contact form to see the demo acknowledgement.

Accessibility and safety notes:
- The modal traps basic keyboard interactions and closes on Escape or backdrop click.
- If the user has "prefers-reduced-motion: reduce" enabled, reveal animations are disabled.
- The page includes a clear crisis and confidentiality statement (not a replacement for emergency services).

Placeholders to replace in templates:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Design considerations:
- Keep visual assets local; the page references assets/img/pattern.svg for the background motif.
- The micro-practice intentionally keeps data on-device; no network calls are made.

Developer notes:
- The scroll reveal uses IntersectionObserver and degrades gracefully.
- The breathing exercise is a timed loop designed for short cycles; adjust cycle length by changing maxCycles or interval durations in the script.
- Intents and journal entries are saved to localStorage under keys starting with "intents" and "practice_journal_".

Legal/clinical copy: text intentionally avoids guarantees and frames services as supportive. Ensure final copy is reviewed by the clinician for tone and accuracy."}
BUNDLE_END
